		{
			dependencies: ["79F4974E23BC93AA"]
			description: [
				"&o&6The pillagers fell, and among their spoils was a corrupted eye. But more importantly, you found fragments of an anomalous journal. The mechanical schematics inside look as if someone was desperately trying to force magic into an engineering blueprint. The handwriting isn't eldritch; it's precise. It looks like a scholar's ledger, but the ink is made of Void. The Council dismisses it as regressive heresy, but these relics may reveal where the miasma truly began.&r&r"
				""
				"&4&o\"Every fragment matters. Even the ones the Council refuses to understand.\"&r&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "6983BBC406DF52C0"
			rewards: [
