		{
			dependencies: ["083CFC179D001044"]
			description: [
				"&6&oAmong the ruins, old scribes left a warning: \"Those who conquer the three elements of the mighty scales may yet prove worthy to face the Warden.\" The Council claims these beasts are the world's immune system, the 'Natural Logic' of the realm. If so, why does it feel like they are attacking the Miasma and us with equal fury?&r&r"
